 *   Scott MacGregor <mscott@netscape.com>
 *   jean-Francois Ducarroz <ducarroz@netscape.com>
 *   Rod Spears <rods@netscape.com>
 *   Karsten "Mnyromyr" D√ºsterloh <mnyromyr@tprac.de>
